version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
keywords:
  - provenance
  - agent memory
  - human-in-the-loop
  - W3C PROV
  - O-1A
  - EB-1A
abstract: >
  Area O1 turns changing documents into traceable claims, routes them through human review, and lets
  future agents see what is supported, disputed or outdated. Its first application is organizing O-1A /
  EB-1A evidence. A Zenodo DOI is attached to each release.
